  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint : Slope of $O A: M_{O A}=\\tan 30^{\\circ}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/nYbu0Ka2zqfiIEcposGxfrwMrtitHo6xmSZIPJcbzWo.original.fullsize.png\"/>\nEquation of $O A: y=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} x$ from parabola \nand line $O A, \\frac{x^2}{3}=4 a x$\n$\\Rightarrow x=12 a \\Rightarrow y=4 \\sqrt{3} a \\therefore A B=2 \\times 4 \\sqrt{3} a=8 a \\sqrt{3}$ unit",
    "image": null
  },
